IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RECONCILIATION-REPORT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EXPECTED-TOTAL PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 1250.00.
01 ACTUAL-TOTAL   PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 1245.00.
01 DIFFERENCE     PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 DISPLAY-AMOUNT PIC Z,ZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF EXPECTED-TOTAL >= ACTUAL-TOTAL
        SUBTRACT ACTUAL-TOTAL
            FROM EXPECTED-TOTAL
            GIVING DIFFERENCE
    ELSE
        SUBTRACT EXPECTED-TOTAL
            FROM ACTUAL-TOTAL
            GIVING DIFFERENCE
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "DAILY RECONCILIATION REPORT"

    MOVE EXPECTED-TOTAL TO DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "EXPECTED TOTAL: " DISPLAY-AMOUNT

    MOVE ACTUAL-TOTAL TO DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "ACTUAL TOTAL:   " DISPLAY-AMOUNT

    MOVE DIFFERENCE TO DISPLAY-AMOUNT
    DISPLAY "DIFFERENCE:     " DISPLAY-AMOUNT

    IF DIFFERENCE = ZERO
        DISPLAY "STATUS: RECONCILED"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "STATUS: INVESTIGATE"
    END-IF

    STOP RUN.
